  "notes": "{早|はや}める is a transitive verb ({他動詞|たどうし}). The intransitive pair is {早|はや}まる (to be brought forward, to quicken).\n\nASPECT ({ている}):\n{早|はや}めている indicates an ongoing action of hastening something.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {予定|よてい}を{早|はや}める - to move up a schedule\n- {足|あし}を{早|はや}める - to quicken one's pace\n- {歩|あゆ}みを{早|はや}める - to quicken one's steps\n- {死|し}を{早|はや}める - to hasten death\n\nPARTICLE PATTERN:\n- [noun]を{早|はや}める - to hasten/bring forward [noun]",
